            "beat_type": "scene_intro",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "魏初",
            "text": "他们两个都在急救室，伤得不轻。你们尽快过来，地址我发给你们。",
            "stage": "电话",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "张尘",
            "text": "[对电话] 老大你冷静，需要我做什么？",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "anchored",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "魏初",
            "text": "[背景音嘈杂] ……先帮我盯着真纪那边，别让她一个人承受。",
            "stage": "电话",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "张尘挂断电话，看向众人。",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "scene_intro",
            "improv": "locked",
            "scene_end": true,
            "pause_after": false
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "十六中校门口": {
    "blurb": "放学时分，校门口人来人往。斑驳和雨璇正在聊天，一个银发青年来走过来问路——命运的齿轮开始转动。",
    "scene_id": "OPENING_SHILIUZHONG_001",
    "available_exits": [
      {
        "place": "等消息去医院",
        "route": "C",
        "scene_id": "OPENING_WAIT_HOSPITAL_001",
        "ch_anchor": 16,
        "kind": "agenda_soft_exit"
      }
    ],
    "chapters": {
      "15": {
        "present": [
          "C.zhangchen.WMAIN",
          "C.banbo.WMAIN",
          "C.yuxuan.WMAIN",
          "C.player.WMAIN"
        ],
        "dialogue_flow": [
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "十六中校外路口，放学时分。人流涌动，学生三三两两走出校门。",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "scene_intro",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "斑驳",
            "text": "（和雨璇聊天）等下要去哪？",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "雨璇",
            "text": "（回应斑驳）随便吧……",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "张尘",
            "text": "你们知道十六中怎么走吗？",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "anchored",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "玩家",
            "text": "",
            "stage": "旁观位",
            "beat_type": "player_choice",
            "improv": "free",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "张尘",
            "text": "这算是，偶遇么？",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "anchored",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "张尘",
            "text": "我请你们吃布丁，要不要去。拜托你们。",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "anchored",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "车祸的消息传来——高速连环车祸，有人重伤。",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "scene_intro",
            "improv": "locked",
            "scene_end": true,
            "pause_after": false
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "等消息去医院": {
    "blurb": "车祸的消息终于来了。一行人匇匇赶往中心医院——修哉和卡卡西在急救室里生死未卜。",
    "scene_id": "OPENING_WAIT_HOSPITAL_001",
    "available_exits": [
      {
        "place": "中心医院合流",
        "route": "C",
        "scene_id": "OPENING_HOSPITAL_001",
        "ch_anchor": 17,
        "kind": "agenda_soft_exit"
      }
    ],
    "chapters": {
      "16": {
        "present": [
          "C.banbo.WMAIN",
          "C.yuxuan.WMAIN",
          "C.zhangchen.WMAIN",
          "C.player.WMAIN"
        ],
        "dialogue_flow": [
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "中心医院急诊大厅。一行人匇匇赶到。",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "scene_intro",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "斑驳",
            "text": "我爸在急救室……",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "玩家",
            "text": "",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "player_choice",
            "improv": "free",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "斑驳在医院找到受伤的修哉和卡卡西。",
            "stage": "医院走廊",
            "beat_type": "scene_intro",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "张尘",
            "text": "所有的卡密码都是241172，虽然都没有多少钱。",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "张尘",
            "text": "不过话说居然都是车祸呢，好巧，该不会是在同一个地方吧。",
            "stage": "-",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "魏初赶到医院。斑驳和雨璇被警方问询。",
            "stage": "医院",
            "beat_type": "scene_intro",
            "improv": "locked",
            "scene_end": true,
            "pause_after": false
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "街角咖啡厅": {
    "blurb": "春末的傍晚，咖啡厅的露台上啤酒瓶叮当作响。",
    "scene_id": "OPENING_SHOOTING_001",
    "available_exits": [
      {
        "place": "京津高速",
        "route": "A",
        "ch_anchor": 16,
        "scene_id": "OPENING_HIGHWAY_001",
        "kind": "agenda_soft_exit"
      },
      {
        "place": "天津·真纪家见张尘",
        "route": "B",
        "ch_anchor": 15,
        "scene_id": "OPENING_TIANJIN_ZHANGCHEN_001",
        "kind": "agenda_soft_exit"
      }
    ],
    "chapters": {
      "13": {
        "present": [
          "C.kakashi.WMAIN",
          "C.xiuzai.WMAIN",
          "C.akito.WMAIN",
          "C.player.WMAIN"
        ],
        "dialogue_flow": [
          {
            "speaker": "修哉",
            "text": "被你那优雅的气质吓傻了。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "修哉",
            "text": "我说，你这胃口是怎么长的？竟然如此能吃。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "秋人",
            "text": "我们还要继续去丢人才好么？",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "几句没头没尾的玩笑在桌边撞在一起，咖啡的热气还没散，街口的风却忽然冷了一点。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "卡卡西",
            "text": "我们去偷海豚吧。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "卡卡西",
            "text": "那么现在这样呢？我们，一起去拯救被束缚的海豚吧。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "修哉",
            "text": "战争中 MIA。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "秋人",
            "text": "好了到此为止，就不要再拿我开涮了吧，时候还早我们不如去赶去看个降旗？",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "秋人",
            "text": "帝都抢购大战，你修行还不够啊少年。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "街边突然传来一声清脆的爆鸣——第一枪。一名少妇头部中弹，鲜血瞬间溅在阳伞上。街道骤然陷入一片死寂。",
            "beat_type": "scene_intro",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "卡卡西",
            "text": "狙击。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "修哉",
            "text": "跑！",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "秋人",
            "text": "阿修？！哇啊！",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "紧接着是第二枪，击倒了街边的一名围观大叔。人群开始疯狂尖叫奔跑。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "卡卡西",
            "text": "这种熟悉的杀意……是那帮人吗。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "卡卡西",
            "text": "我正在做。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "卡卡西感知到杀意，闪避子弹。子弹贴着他的发丝飞过，将身后的雕花铁栏轰然震断。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "卡卡西",
            "text": "我，被当做目标？很有可能是，那么绝对不能牵连到旁边的人……",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "修哉",
            "text": "对面大厦的十层，有个拿着狙击枪的人。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "修哉抓起面粉袋撒向空气，视野模糊，三人汇合。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "卡卡西",
            "text": "他，套着黑色的头套，我也只能看个轮廓。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "秋人",
            "text": "我照下来了，不过，只是轮廓的话也许没什么用吧。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "卡卡西",
            "text": "我已经在这么做了。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "卡卡西用神威折弯狙击手的枪支，狙击手撤退。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "卡卡西",
            "text": "那家伙，居然走了。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "秋人",
            "text": "大冷天我居然出了一身汗，也算是不错的精神锻炼了吧。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "秋人",
            "text": "那个，你没事吧？刚才有没有被碎片擦到？",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "卡卡西脱下外套披在受惊的路人肩上，确认她没有被碎片伤到。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": true,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "修哉",
            "text": "好了到此为止，具体为什么要丢下你一个人，我们回头再解释行不行。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "修哉看了一眼卡卡西的动作，低声吐槽：「这种时候还演什么言情剧。」",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "秋人",
            "text": "总觉得，我好像记录下来很多不错的画面，回头当作绘画素材好了。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "卡卡西",
            "text": "亲热天堂。",
            "beat_type": "normal",
            "improv": "locked",
            "pause_after": false,
            "scene_end": false,
            "stage": "-"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "导演",
            "text": "「下一站，你们要去哪里？」",
            "beat_type": "player_choice",
            "improv": "free",
            "scene_end": true,
            "pause_after": true,
            "stage": "-"
          }
        ],
        "encounters": [
          {
            "beat": "春末傍晚的露天咖啡座上，咖啡的香气还没散去，午后的阳光温暖如初，但危险已经无声降临。",
            "canon_src": "E013-01~E013-11",
            "canon_anchor": "OPENING-E013-01"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
